  "glossary": {
    "serviceNoun": "vertical",
    "flowNoun": "journey",
    "stepNoun": "stage",
    "entityNoun": "club",
    "ownerNoun": "owning team",
    "description": "Arrivia (demo) is a SYNTHETIC copy of the Arrivia company profile used by the demo stack. Arrivia runs white-label travel booking sites for member clubs. A member arrives on a club-branded site and moves through a booking funnel - search, results, detail, pre-book, checkout, booking, confirmation - in one of four verticals: Hotels, Cars, Cruises and Air. Hotels and Cars share one storefront (and the club front end); Cruises runs on its own core and API; Air has its own UI and API. Login, checkout, booking, confirmation and cancellation hit the same endpoints whatever the member is buying, so they are grouped as Shared Booking Services. Who is affected is always a club: a stamped club id (VacationClubId) wins, otherwise the club-branded hostname identifies it. Every club id, host and number in the demo is invented."
  },
  "enabled": true,
  "notes": "Demo pack (Portal/demo/packs/tourism). Services, stages, matchers and identity sources mirror the real Arrivia profile; the air service, the club alias on the Hotels/Cars/Shared verticals and the partners are demo additions. Synthetic data only.",
